What would be the Latex code to implement selection sort algorithm using PHP to find the alphabetically first string in a list of strings? Given the input list: 
$fruits = array("Banana", "Apple", "Orange");
Provide the corresponding Latex output of the program after the implementation of the selection sort algorithm.

output:
The PHP code to implement selection sort algorithm to find the alphabetically first string in a list of strings would be:
```
<?php
$fruits = array("Banana", "Apple", "Orange");
$len = count($fruits);
for ($i = 0; $i < $len-1; $i++) {
    $min = $i;
    for ($j = $i+1; $j < $len; $j++) {
        if (strcasecmp($fruits[$j], $fruits[$min]) < 0) {
            $min = $j;
        }
    }
    $temp = $fruits[$i];
    $fruits[$i] = $fruits[$min];
    $fruits[$min] = $temp;
}
echo "The alphabetically first string in the list is: " . $fruits[0];
?>
```
The corresponding Latex output of the program after the implementation of the selection sort algorithm would be:
```
The alphabetically first string in the list is: Apple
```

